      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring educational science documentaries on vtv7 provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in VTV7 channel or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with space science. Many students find that watching science quizzes helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about wildlife habits broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nEducational Science Documentaries on VTV7 has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate VTV7 channel. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases space science and provides deep perspectives on wildlife habits. Many teenagers report that participating in watching science quizzes enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize famous host as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
