          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my opinion, Educational Science Documentaries on VTV7 is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with VTV7 channel while promoting space science. Engaging in watching science quizzes helps students relieve academic stress and develop wildlife habits. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of famous host encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
