      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about School Badminton Championship at the Stadium related to school stadium.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by shuttlecock speed and love practicing badminton.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of teamwork spirit, and highlights gold medal.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring school badminton championship at the stadium provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in school stadium or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with shuttlecock speed. Many students find that practicing badminton helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about teamwork spirit broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "School Badminton Championship at the Stadium has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate school stadium. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases shuttlecock speed and provides deep perspectives on teamwork spirit. Many teenagers report that participating in practicing badminton enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize gold medal as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring school badminton championship at the stadium provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in school stadium or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with shuttlecock speed. Many students find that practicing badminton helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about teamwork spirit broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSchool Badminton Championship at the Stadium has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate school stadium. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases shuttlecock speed and provides deep perspectives on teamwork spirit. Many teenagers report that participating in practicing badminton enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize gold medal as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, School Badminton Championship at the Stadium is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with school stadium while promoting shuttlecock speed. Engaging in practicing badminton helps students relieve academic stress and develop teamwork spirit. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of gold medal encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
