      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about Animated Cartoons and Moral Lessons for Children related to cartoon series.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by colourful characters and love sketching drawings.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of humorous dialogue, and highlights creative animator.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring animated cartoons and moral lessons for children provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in cartoon series or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with colourful characters. Many students find that sketching drawings helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about humorous dialogue broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Animated Cartoons and Moral Lessons for Children has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate cartoon series. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases colourful characters and provides deep perspectives on humorous dialogue. Many teenagers report that participating in sketching drawings enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize creative animator as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring animated cartoons and moral lessons for children provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in cartoon series or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with colourful characters. Many students find that sketching drawings helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about humorous dialogue broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAnimated Cartoons and Moral Lessons for Children has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate cartoon series. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases colourful characters and provides deep perspectives on humorous dialogue. Many teenagers report that participating in sketching drawings enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize creative animator as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Animated Cartoons and Moral Lessons for Children is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with cartoon series while promoting colourful characters. Engaging in sketching drawings helps students relieve academic stress and develop humorous dialogue. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of creative animator encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
