      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about Exciting Football Tournament on Sunday Morning related to sports field.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by green pitch and love scoring goals.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of enthusiastic cheering, and highlights referee whistle.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring exciting football tournament on sunday morning provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in sports field or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with green pitch. Many students find that scoring goals helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about enthusiastic cheering broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Exciting Football Tournament on Sunday Morning has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate sports field. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases green pitch and provides deep perspectives on enthusiastic cheering. Many teenagers report that participating in scoring goals enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize referee whistle as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring exciting football tournament on sunday morning provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in sports field or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with green pitch. Many students find that scoring goals helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about enthusiastic cheering broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nExciting Football Tournament on Sunday Morning has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate sports field. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases green pitch and provides deep perspectives on enthusiastic cheering. Many teenagers report that participating in scoring goals enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize referee whistle as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
