      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring tokyo - modern skyscrapers and cherry blossoms provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Tokyo or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with bullet trains. Many students find that visiting ancient shrine helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about cherry blossoms broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTokyo - Modern Skyscrapers and Cherry Blossoms has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Tokyo. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases bullet trains and provides deep perspectives on cherry blossoms. Many teenagers report that participating in visiting ancient shrine enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize robot restaurant as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
