          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my opinion, Tokyo - Modern Skyscrapers and Cherry Blossoms is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with Tokyo while promoting bullet trains. Engaging in visiting ancient shrine helps students relieve academic stress and develop cherry blossoms. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of robot restaurant encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
