          "text": "Write a paragraph (50-60 words) about How Modern Smart Televisions Connect Families.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Why you like it; Important features of cozy living room; What benefits it brings; How it helps your study.",
          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my opinion, How Modern Smart Televisions Connect Families is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with cozy living room while promoting high-definition screen. Engaging in discussing moral plots helps students relieve academic stress and develop family movie nights. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of smart remote encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
