      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about Young Inventors and Technology Shows on TV related to tech channel.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by solar gadgets and love designing circuits.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of student robots, and highlights innovative engineer.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring young inventors and technology shows on tv provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in tech channel or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with solar gadgets. Many students find that designing circuits helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about student robots broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Young Inventors and Technology Shows on TV has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate tech channel. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases solar gadgets and provides deep perspectives on student robots. Many teenagers report that participating in designing circuits enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize innovative engineer as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring young inventors and technology shows on tv provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in tech channel or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with solar gadgets. Many students find that designing circuits helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about student robots broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nYoung Inventors and Technology Shows on TV has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate tech channel. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases solar gadgets and provides deep perspectives on student robots. Many teenagers report that participating in designing circuits enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize innovative engineer as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
