      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Young Inventors and Technology Shows on TV is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with tech channel while promoting solar gadgets. Engaging in designing circuits helps students relieve academic stress and develop student robots. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of innovative engineer encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
