      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about Basketball Drills and Health Benefits for Youths related to basketball court.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by hoop and backboard and love passing the ball.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of dribbling skills, and highlights sports shoes.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring basketball drills and health benefits for youths provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in basketball court or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with hoop and backboard. Many students find that passing the ball helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about dribbling skills broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Basketball Drills and Health Benefits for Youths has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate basketball court. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases hoop and backboard and provides deep perspectives on dribbling skills. Many teenagers report that participating in passing the ball enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize sports shoes as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring basketball drills and health benefits for youths provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in basketball court or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with hoop and backboard. Many students find that passing the ball helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about dribbling skills broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBasketball Drills and Health Benefits for Youths has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate basketball court. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases hoop and backboard and provides deep perspectives on dribbling skills. Many teenagers report that participating in passing the ball enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize sports shoes as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Basketball Drills and Health Benefits for Youths is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with basketball court while promoting hoop and backboard. Engaging in passing the ball helps students relieve academic stress and develop dribbling skills. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of sports shoes encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
