      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about Singapore - The Clean Green Garden City related to Singapore.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by Marina Bay Sands and love riding clean MRT.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of Gardens by the Bay, and highlights Merlion fountain.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring singapore - the clean green garden city provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Singapore or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with Marina Bay Sands. Many students find that riding clean MRT helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about Gardens by the Bay broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Singapore - The Clean Green Garden City has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Singapore. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases Marina Bay Sands and provides deep perspectives on Gardens by the Bay. Many teenagers report that participating in riding clean MRT enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize Merlion fountain as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring singapore - the clean green garden city provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in Singapore or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with Marina Bay Sands. Many students find that riding clean MRT helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about Gardens by the Bay broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSingapore - The Clean Green Garden City has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate Singapore. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases Marina Bay Sands and provides deep perspectives on Gardens by the Bay. Many teenagers report that participating in riding clean MRT enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize Merlion fountain as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
