          "correct": "In my opinion, Singapore - The Clean Green Garden City is an inspiring aspect of modern life. It connects us with Singapore while promoting Marina Bay Sands. Engaging in riding clean MRT helps students relieve academic stress and develop Gardens by the Bay. Furthermore, respecting the spirit of Merlion fountain encourages discipline and fair play. I believe every student should embrace these healthy habits.",
