      "audioScript": "What programme or sport are you researching for English class?\nI am presenting about Managing Screen Time for Healthy Eyes and Mind related to home study desk.\nWhat is the most exciting aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are fascinated by timed viewing timer and love reading books.\nHow does it inspire young students?\nIt encourages teamwork, expands knowledge of outdoor exercise, and highlights healthy vision.\nThat is brilliant! I look forward to listening to your speech.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring managing screen time for healthy eyes and mind provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in home study desk or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with timed viewing timer. Many students find that reading books helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about outdoor exercise broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.",
      "readingText": "Managing Screen Time for Healthy Eyes and Mind has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate home study desk. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases timed viewing timer and provides deep perspectives on outdoor exercise. Many teenagers report that participating in reading books enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize healthy vision as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring managing screen time for healthy eyes and mind provides valuable lessons for secondary school students. Whether situated in home study desk or on international screens, this subject inspires teenagers with timed viewing timer. Many students find that reading books helps them build self-confidence and (23) ________. However, experts advise viewers that they (24) ________ spend too many consecutive hours in front of screens. Instead, balancing television viewing with outdoor physical (25) ________ ensures good health. In addition, learning about outdoor exercise broadens our awareness of the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, approaching entertainment with a smart mindset leads to a (27) ________ lifestyle.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nManaging Screen Time for Healthy Eyes and Mind has captured the enthusiastic interest of young audiences who appreciate home study desk. Combining informative insights with engaging entertainment, it showcases timed viewing timer and provides deep perspectives on outdoor exercise. Many teenagers report that participating in reading books enhances their concentration, boosts physical endurance, and alleviates academic stress. Moreover, instructors and educators emphasize healthy vision as a core pillar of personal development and fair play. Whether practicing on sports grounds or exploring international landmarks, students acquire practical knowledge that transcends textbooks. Cultivating healthy habits through balanced sports and informative media prepares youths for success in modern society.",
