      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Traffic Safety and Helmet Regulations for Students at school traffic gate.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by fastening safety helmets and enjoy cycling in bike lanes.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes zebra pedestrian crossings and emphasizes the vital role of traffic police officer.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in school traffic gate or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that cycling in bike lanes provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, fastening safety helmets continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Traffic Safety and Helmet Regulations for Students offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in school traffic gate. Every year, thousands of people experience fastening safety helmets and celebrate zebra pedestrian crossings, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in cycling in bike lanes gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize traffic police officer to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in school traffic gate or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that cycling in bike lanes provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, fastening safety helmets continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTraffic Safety and Helmet Regulations for Students offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in school traffic gate. Every year, thousands of people experience fastening safety helmets and celebrate zebra pedestrian crossings, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in cycling in bike lanes gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize traffic police officer to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
