      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about A Gripping Science-Fiction Film Premiere at modern cinema.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by spectacular visual effects and enjoy watching 3D sci-fi films.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes talented lead actors and emphasizes the vital role of thoughtful film director.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in modern cinema or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that watching 3D sci-fi films provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, spectacular visual effects continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "A Gripping Science-Fiction Film Premiere offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in modern cinema. Every year, thousands of people experience spectacular visual effects and celebrate talented lead actors, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in watching 3D sci-fi films gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize thoughtful film director to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in modern cinema or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that watching 3D sci-fi films provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, spectacular visual effects continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nA Gripping Science-Fiction Film Premiere offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in modern cinema. Every year, thousands of people experience spectacular visual effects and celebrate talented lead actors, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in watching 3D sci-fi films gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize thoughtful film director to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
