          "correct": "In my view, Mid-Autumn Festival Lantern Parade and Mooncakes plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in village square reminds everyone of the paramount importance of star-shaped colourful lanterns. When taking part in tasting baked mooncakes, people learn how vibrant lion dances enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to drumming rhythms ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
