      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Safe Pedestrian Habits and Overpass Bridges at busy urban boulevard.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by elevated pedestrian bridges and enjoy crossing streets safely.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes obeying red traffic lights and emphasizes the vital role of safety reflective vest.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in busy urban boulevard or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that crossing streets safely provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, elevated pedestrian bridges continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Safe Pedestrian Habits and Overpass Bridges offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in busy urban boulevard. Every year, thousands of people experience elevated pedestrian bridges and celebrate obeying red traffic lights, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in crossing streets safely gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize safety reflective vest to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in busy urban boulevard or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that crossing streets safely provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, elevated pedestrian bridges continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSafe Pedestrian Habits and Overpass Bridges offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in busy urban boulevard. Every year, thousands of people experience elevated pedestrian bridges and celebrate obeying red traffic lights, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in crossing streets safely gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize safety reflective vest to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
