          "correct": "In my view, Safe Pedestrian Habits and Overpass Bridges plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in busy urban boulevard reminds everyone of the paramount importance of elevated pedestrian bridges. When taking part in crossing streets safely, people learn how obeying red traffic lights enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to safety reflective vest ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
