      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Carnival Season in Rio de Janeiro at Rio de Janeiro.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by dazzling samba costumes and enjoy dancing lively samba.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes elaborate parade floats and emphasizes the vital role of parade grandstand.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in Rio de Janeiro or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that dancing lively samba provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, dazzling samba costumes continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Carnival Season in Rio de Janeiro offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in Rio de Janeiro. Every year, thousands of people experience dazzling samba costumes and celebrate elaborate parade floats, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in dancing lively samba gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize parade grandstand to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in Rio de Janeiro or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that dancing lively samba provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, dazzling samba costumes continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nCarnival Season in Rio de Janeiro offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in Rio de Janeiro. Every year, thousands of people experience dazzling samba costumes and celebrate elaborate parade floats, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in dancing lively samba gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize parade grandstand to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
