          "correct": "In my view, Carnival Season in Rio de Janeiro plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in Rio de Janeiro reminds everyone of the paramount importance of dazzling samba costumes. When taking part in dancing lively samba, people learn how elaborate parade floats enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to parade grandstand ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
