      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Electric Scooters and Road Regulations for Youths at secondary school campus.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by electric scooter helmet rules and enjoy riding at safe speeds.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes designated bicycle paths and emphasizes the vital role of school safety guard.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in secondary school campus or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that riding at safe speeds provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, electric scooter helmet rules continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Electric Scooters and Road Regulations for Youths offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in secondary school campus. Every year, thousands of people experience electric scooter helmet rules and celebrate designated bicycle paths, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in riding at safe speeds gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize school safety guard to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in secondary school campus or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that riding at safe speeds provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, electric scooter helmet rules continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nElectric Scooters and Road Regulations for Youths offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in secondary school campus. Every year, thousands of people experience electric scooter helmet rules and celebrate designated bicycle paths, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in riding at safe speeds gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize school safety guard to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
