          "correct": "In my view, Electric Scooters and Road Regulations for Youths plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in secondary school campus reminds everyone of the paramount importance of electric scooter helmet rules. When taking part in riding at safe speeds, people learn how designated bicycle paths enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to school safety guard ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
