      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Thanksgiving Dinner and Family Reunion Traditions at North American home.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by roast turkey with stuffing and enjoy sharing gratitude stories.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes cranberry sauce and pies and emphasizes the vital role of pumpkin dessert.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in North American home or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that sharing gratitude stories provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, roast turkey with stuffing continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Thanksgiving Dinner and Family Reunion Traditions offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in North American home. Every year, thousands of people experience roast turkey with stuffing and celebrate cranberry sauce and pies, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in sharing gratitude stories gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize pumpkin dessert to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in North American home or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that sharing gratitude stories provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, roast turkey with stuffing continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThanksgiving Dinner and Family Reunion Traditions offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in North American home. Every year, thousands of people experience roast turkey with stuffing and celebrate cranberry sauce and pies, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in sharing gratitude stories gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize pumpkin dessert to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
