          "correct": "In my view, Thanksgiving Dinner and Family Reunion Traditions plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in North American home reminds everyone of the paramount importance of roast turkey with stuffing. When taking part in sharing gratitude stories, people learn how cranberry sauce and pies enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to pumpkin dessert ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
