      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Preventing Traffic Congestion with Public Buses at city bus terminal.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by dedicated bus rapid lanes and enjoy commuting by public transit.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes discounted student bus cards and emphasizes the vital role of friendly bus driver.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in city bus terminal or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that commuting by public transit provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, dedicated bus rapid lanes continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Preventing Traffic Congestion with Public Buses offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in city bus terminal. Every year, thousands of people experience dedicated bus rapid lanes and celebrate discounted student bus cards, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in commuting by public transit gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize friendly bus driver to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in city bus terminal or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that commuting by public transit provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, dedicated bus rapid lanes continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nPreventing Traffic Congestion with Public Buses offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in city bus terminal. Every year, thousands of people experience dedicated bus rapid lanes and celebrate discounted student bus cards, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in commuting by public transit gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize friendly bus driver to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
