          "correct": "In my view, Preventing Traffic Congestion with Public Buses plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in city bus terminal reminds everyone of the paramount importance of dedicated bus rapid lanes. When taking part in commuting by public transit, people learn how discounted student bus cards enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to friendly bus driver ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
