      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Historical War Films and Lessons on Peace at historical cinema.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by authentic period costumes and enjoy learning national history.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes moving orchestral soundtrack and emphasizes the vital role of courageous soldier.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in historical cinema or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that learning national history provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, authentic period costumes continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Historical War Films and Lessons on Peace offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in historical cinema. Every year, thousands of people experience authentic period costumes and celebrate moving orchestral soundtrack, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in learning national history gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize courageous soldier to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in historical cinema or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that learning national history provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, authentic period costumes continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHistorical War Films and Lessons on Peace offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in historical cinema. Every year, thousands of people experience authentic period costumes and celebrate moving orchestral soundtrack, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in learning national history gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize courageous soldier to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
