          "correct": "In my view, Historical War Films and Lessons on Peace plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in historical cinema reminds everyone of the paramount importance of authentic period costumes. When taking part in learning national history, people learn how moving orchestral soundtrack enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to courageous soldier ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
