          "correct": "In my view, La Tomatina - The Famous Tomato Festival in Spain plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in Bunol village reminds everyone of the paramount importance of ripe tomato throwing. When taking part in joining tomato battles, people learn how crowd singing and water cannons enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to festival clean-up truck ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
