          "correct": "In my view, Zebra Crossings and Pavement Etiquette in Cities plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in pedestrian boulevard reminds everyone of the paramount importance of white painted zebra stripes. When taking part in stopping for pedestrians, people learn how clear obstacle-free sidewalks enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to city traffic planner ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
