      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Elephant Race Festival in Central Highlands at Don Village.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by majestic Asian elephants and enjoy racing along riverbanks.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes cheering village crowd and emphasizes the vital role of mahout elephant trainer.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in Don Village or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that racing along riverbanks provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, majestic Asian elephants continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Elephant Race Festival in Central Highlands offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in Don Village. Every year, thousands of people experience majestic Asian elephants and celebrate cheering village crowd, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in racing along riverbanks gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize mahout elephant trainer to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in Don Village or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that racing along riverbanks provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, majestic Asian elephants continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nElephant Race Festival in Central Highlands offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in Don Village. Every year, thousands of people experience majestic Asian elephants and celebrate cheering village crowd, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in racing along riverbanks gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize mahout elephant trainer to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
