          "correct": "In my view, Elephant Race Festival in Central Highlands plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in Don Village reminds everyone of the paramount importance of majestic Asian elephants. When taking part in racing along riverbanks, people learn how cheering village crowd enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to mahout elephant trainer ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
