          "correct": "In my view, Safety Rules on Public Trains and Metro Lines plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in metro railway station reminds everyone of the paramount importance of safety platform doors. When taking part in riding clean electric trains, people learn how standing behind yellow lines enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to station master ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
