      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Behind the Scenes of Action Stunt Performances at film production set.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by carefully rigged stunt wires and enjoy practicing martial art stunts.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes protective safety pads and emphasizes the vital role of experienced stunt coordinator.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in film production set or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that practicing martial art stunts provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, carefully rigged stunt wires continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Behind the Scenes of Action Stunt Performances offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in film production set. Every year, thousands of people experience carefully rigged stunt wires and celebrate protective safety pads, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in practicing martial art stunts gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize experienced stunt coordinator to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in film production set or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that practicing martial art stunts provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, carefully rigged stunt wires continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBehind the Scenes of Action Stunt Performances offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in film production set. Every year, thousands of people experience carefully rigged stunt wires and celebrate protective safety pads, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in practicing martial art stunts gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize experienced stunt coordinator to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
