      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Halloween Traditions - Costumes and Jack-o-Lanterns at suburban neighbourhood.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by carved pumpkin lanterns and enjoy wearing wizard costumes.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes spooky trick-or-treating and emphasizes the vital role of sweet fruit candy.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in suburban neighbourhood or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that wearing wizard costumes provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, carved pumpkin lanterns continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Halloween Traditions - Costumes and Jack-o-Lanterns offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in suburban neighbourhood. Every year, thousands of people experience carved pumpkin lanterns and celebrate spooky trick-or-treating, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in wearing wizard costumes gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize sweet fruit candy to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in suburban neighbourhood or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that wearing wizard costumes provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, carved pumpkin lanterns continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHalloween Traditions - Costumes and Jack-o-Lanterns offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in suburban neighbourhood. Every year, thousands of people experience carved pumpkin lanterns and celebrate spooky trick-or-treating, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in wearing wizard costumes gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize sweet fruit candy to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
