          "correct": "In my view, Halloween Traditions - Costumes and Jack-o-Lanterns plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in suburban neighbourhood reminds everyone of the paramount importance of carved pumpkin lanterns. When taking part in wearing wizard costumes, people learn how spooky trick-or-treating enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to sweet fruit candy ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
