      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Green Transport Solutions: Modern Metro Systems at city rapid transit.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by underground railway tunnels and enjoy boarding express metro trains.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes zero carbon emissions and emphasizes the vital role of solar powered ticket gate.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in city rapid transit or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that boarding express metro trains provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, underground railway tunnels continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Green Transport Solutions: Modern Metro Systems offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in city rapid transit. Every year, thousands of people experience underground railway tunnels and celebrate zero carbon emissions, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in boarding express metro trains gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize solar powered ticket gate to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in city rapid transit or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that boarding express metro trains provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, underground railway tunnels continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nGreen Transport Solutions: Modern Metro Systems offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in city rapid transit. Every year, thousands of people experience underground railway tunnels and celebrate zero carbon emissions, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in boarding express metro trains gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize solar powered ticket gate to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
