      "audioScript": "What topic are you investigating for the unit on traffic, films, and festivals?\nI am presenting about Film Soundtracks and Emotional Storytelling at music recording studio.\nWhat is the most memorable aspect of this topic?\nAudiences and participants are amazed by grand orchestral strings and enjoy composing film music.\nHow does it teach students valuable lessons?\nIt promotes melodic character themes and emphasizes the vital role of symphony conductor.\nThat is fascinating! The whole class will learn so much from your talk.",
      "clozeText": "Studying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in music recording studio or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that composing film music provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, grand orchestral strings continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.",
      "readingText": "Film Soundtracks and Emotional Storytelling offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in music recording studio. Every year, thousands of people experience grand orchestral strings and celebrate melodic character themes, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in composing film music gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize symphony conductor to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nStudying modern transportation, cinematography, and world celebrations enriches our global awareness. Whether located in music recording studio or on international screens, this subject highlights the value of (23) ________. When traveling on roads or attending festivals, citizens (24) ________ obey safety guidelines strictly. Many young people find that composing film music provides memorable moments of (25) ________ and cultural learning. Although there are challenges in traffic management or film production, grand orchestral strings continues to (26) ________ millions of people. In conclusion, respecting rules and embracing diverse cultures will create a (27) ________ global community.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nFilm Soundtracks and Emotional Storytelling offers a compelling perspective on contemporary society and cultural traditions in music recording studio. Every year, thousands of people experience grand orchestral strings and celebrate melodic character themes, generating widespread public enthusiasm. Participants who engage in composing film music gain deeper insights into community solidarity and civic responsibility. Safety supervisors and creative artists emphasize symphony conductor to ensure activities run smoothly without compromising public wellbeing. Furthermore, whether navigating bustling traffic corridors or immersing in cinematic masterpieces, learners develop critical thinking. By balancing modern technological progress with time-honoured cultural festivities, communities flourish with vitality and mutual respect.",
