          "correct": "In my view, Film Soundtracks and Emotional Storytelling plays an essential role in contemporary society. Practicing in music recording studio reminds everyone of the paramount importance of grand orchestral strings. When taking part in composing film music, people learn how melodic character themes enriches communal life. Moreover, paying close attention to symphony conductor ensures that safety and joy go hand in hand. I hope everyone will embrace these responsible habits.",
