      "audioScript": "What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nI am presenting about Combating Ocean Acidification and Coral Bleaching in Nha Trang at Hon Mun marine reserve.\nWhat is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nExperts and citizens are paying close attention to delicate staghorn coral beds and promoting monitoring sea water acidity.\nHow does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nIt mitigates temperature-resistant coral nurseries and emphasizes the vital function of marine conservation scuba team.\nOutstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Hon Mun marine reserve, stakeholders are addressing delicate staghorn coral beds to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in monitoring sea water acidity, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and marine conservation scuba team guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Combating Ocean Acidification and Coral Bleaching in Nha Trang addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Hon Mun marine reserve. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified delicate staghorn coral beds, necessitating urgent action on temperature-resistant coral nurseries. Citizens and volunteers who commit to monitoring sea water acidity have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on marine conservation scuba team to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Hon Mun marine reserve, stakeholders are addressing delicate staghorn coral beds to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in monitoring sea water acidity, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and marine conservation scuba team guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nCombating Ocean Acidification and Coral Bleaching in Nha Trang addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Hon Mun marine reserve. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified delicate staghorn coral beds, necessitating urgent action on temperature-resistant coral nurseries. Citizens and volunteers who commit to monitoring sea water acidity have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on marine conservation scuba team to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
