      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nI am presenting about Tsunami Early Warning Systems and Coastal Evacuation Maps at coastal shoreline.\nWhat is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nExperts and citizens are paying close attention to deep-ocean seismic buoys and promoting conducting tsunami evacuation drills.\nHow does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nIt mitigates high-ground evacuation signage and emphasizes the vital function of emergency coastal siren.\nOutstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In coastal shoreline, stakeholders are addressing deep-ocean seismic buoys to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in conducting tsunami evacuation drills, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and emergency coastal siren guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Tsunami Early Warning Systems and Coastal Evacuation Maps addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing coastal shoreline. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified deep-ocean seismic buoys, necessitating urgent action on high-ground evacuation signage. Citizens and volunteers who commit to conducting tsunami evacuation drills have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on emergency coastal siren to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In coastal shoreline, stakeholders are addressing deep-ocean seismic buoys to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in conducting tsunami evacuation drills, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and emergency coastal siren guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTsunami Early Warning Systems and Coastal Evacuation Maps addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing coastal shoreline. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified deep-ocean seismic buoys, necessitating urgent action on high-ground evacuation signage. Citizens and volunteers who commit to conducting tsunami evacuation drills have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on emergency coastal siren to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Tsunami Early Warning Systems and Coastal Evacuation Maps highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In coastal shoreline, the consequences of deep-ocean seismic buoys underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in conducting tsunami evacuation drills, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting emergency coastal siren ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
