      "audioScript": "What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nI am presenting about Forest Fire Prevention and Firebreak Clearcuts in Pine Forests at Da Lat pine ridges.\nWhat is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nExperts and citizens are paying close attention to cleared bare earth firebreaks and promoting reporting smoke sightings.\nHow does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nIt mitigates infrared heat detection drones and emphasizes the vital function of firefighter lookout tower.\nOutstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Da Lat pine ridges, stakeholders are addressing cleared bare earth firebreaks to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in reporting smoke sightings, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and firefighter lookout tower guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Forest Fire Prevention and Firebreak Clearcuts in Pine Forests addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Da Lat pine ridges. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified cleared bare earth firebreaks, necessitating urgent action on infrared heat detection drones. Citizens and volunteers who commit to reporting smoke sightings have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on firefighter lookout tower to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Da Lat pine ridges, stakeholders are addressing cleared bare earth firebreaks to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in reporting smoke sightings, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and firefighter lookout tower guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nForest Fire Prevention and Firebreak Clearcuts in Pine Forests addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Da Lat pine ridges. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified cleared bare earth firebreaks, necessitating urgent action on infrared heat detection drones. Citizens and volunteers who commit to reporting smoke sightings have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on firefighter lookout tower to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
