      "audioScript": "What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nI am presenting about Protecting Mangrove Forests from Industrial Encroachment at Can Gio biosphere reserve.\nWhat is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nExperts and citizens are paying close attention to tangled mangrove stilt roots and promoting planting young mangrove propagules.\nHow does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nIt mitigates filtering coastal mud sediments and emphasizes the vital function of mangrove forestry ranger.\nOutstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Can Gio biosphere reserve, stakeholders are addressing tangled mangrove stilt roots to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in planting young mangrove propagules, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and mangrove forestry ranger guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Protecting Mangrove Forests from Industrial Encroachment addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Can Gio biosphere reserve. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified tangled mangrove stilt roots, necessitating urgent action on filtering coastal mud sediments. Citizens and volunteers who commit to planting young mangrove propagules have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on mangrove forestry ranger to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In Can Gio biosphere reserve, stakeholders are addressing tangled mangrove stilt roots to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in planting young mangrove propagules, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and mangrove forestry ranger guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nProtecting Mangrove Forests from Industrial Encroachment addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing Can Gio biosphere reserve. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified tangled mangrove stilt roots, necessitating urgent action on filtering coastal mud sediments. Citizens and volunteers who commit to planting young mangrove propagules have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on mangrove forestry ranger to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
