      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Barcodes, QR Payments, and Cashless Supermarket Counters highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In hypermarket checkout, the consequences of instant QR code scanners underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in paying via smartphone wallet, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting self-service checkout kiosk ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
