      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What environmental, shopping, or disaster response issue are you reviewing?\nI am presenting about Landslide Risk Assessment and Geo-Technical Sensors at mountain hillside road.\nWhat is the most critical aspect of this situation?\nExperts and citizens are paying close attention to geological slope inclinometers and promoting installing steel wire netting.\nHow does it safeguard human communities or foster sustainability?\nIt mitigates reinforcing unstable hillsides and emphasizes the vital function of geological engineer team.\nOutstanding! This presentation addresses urgent real-world challenges.",
      "clozeText": "Protecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In mountain hillside road, stakeholders are addressing geological slope inclinometers to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in installing steel wire netting, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and geological engineer team guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Landslide Risk Assessment and Geo-Technical Sensors addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing mountain hillside road. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified geological slope inclinometers, necessitating urgent action on reinforcing unstable hillsides. Citizens and volunteers who commit to installing steel wire netting have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on geological engineer team to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nProtecting our natural environment and responding effectively to natural hazards are critical civic responsibilities. In mountain hillside road, stakeholders are addressing geological slope inclinometers to safeguard local ecosystems and (23) ________. When consumers engage in installing steel wire netting, they reduce unnecessary waste and support sustainable (24) ________. Meanwhile, during severe weather events, residents (25) ________ follow official emergency evacuation instructions. Modern technology, such as early warning sensors, helps communities minimize the destruction caused by natural (26) ________. In conclusion, proactive collaboration and geological engineer team guarantee a safer, more resilient (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLandslide Risk Assessment and Geo-Technical Sensors addresses one of the most pressing environmental and socioeconomic challenges facing mountain hillside road. Over recent years, rapid urbanization and climate variations have intensified geological slope inclinometers, necessitating urgent action on reinforcing unstable hillsides. Citizens and volunteers who commit to installing steel wire netting have demonstrated that grassroots initiatives can yield tangible ecological benefits. Furthermore, emergency responders and urban planners rely heavily on geological engineer team to prevent casualties and maintain civic order. Whether making conscious ethical retail choices or strengthening infrastructure against natural perils, public awareness remains paramount. By combining responsible environmental stewardship with scientific hazard preparedness, communities construct a resilient foundation.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Landslide Risk Assessment and Geo-Technical Sensors highlights critical challenges that demand immediate public attention. In mountain hillside road, the consequences of geological slope inclinometers underline the necessity of environmental vigilance. By actively taking part in installing steel wire netting, citizens can alleviate ecological strain and protect vulnerable areas. Furthermore, supporting geological engineer team ensures that our communities remain resilient against natural hazards. Together, we can build a secure and sustainable future.",
