      "audioScript": "What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nI am presenting about English as a Global Lingua Franca in International Trade at diplomatic convention center.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nAudiences and experts are intrigued by multilingual business delegates and eager to practice negotiating trade agreements.\nHow does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nIt showcases standard international English and highlights the significance of simultaneous interpreter booth.\nBrilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In diplomatic convention center, culinary masters and linguists emphasize multilingual business delegates as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace negotiating trade agreements, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding standard international English helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting simultaneous interpreter booth paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "English as a Global Lingua Franca in International Trade represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in diplomatic convention center. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines multilingual business delegates with standard international English. Travelers and researchers who practice negotiating trade agreements gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight simultaneous interpreter booth as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In diplomatic convention center, culinary masters and linguists emphasize multilingual business delegates as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace negotiating trade agreements, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding standard international English helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting simultaneous interpreter booth paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nEnglish as a Global Lingua Franca in International Trade represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in diplomatic convention center. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines multilingual business delegates with standard international English. Travelers and researchers who practice negotiating trade agreements gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight simultaneous interpreter booth as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
