      "audioScript": "What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nI am presenting about Baking Traditional Steamed Sticky Rice in Bamboo Tubes (Com Lam) at highland campfire.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nAudiences and experts are intrigued by fresh sweet mountain bamboo stalks and eager to practice roasting tubes on glowing embers.\nHow does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nIt showcases fragrant sticky rice and coconut and highlights the significance of bamboo split knife.\nBrilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In highland campfire, culinary masters and linguists emphasize fresh sweet mountain bamboo stalks as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace roasting tubes on glowing embers, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding fragrant sticky rice and coconut helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting bamboo split knife paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Baking Traditional Steamed Sticky Rice in Bamboo Tubes (Com Lam) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in highland campfire. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines fresh sweet mountain bamboo stalks with fragrant sticky rice and coconut. Travelers and researchers who practice roasting tubes on glowing embers gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight bamboo split knife as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In highland campfire, culinary masters and linguists emphasize fresh sweet mountain bamboo stalks as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace roasting tubes on glowing embers, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding fragrant sticky rice and coconut helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting bamboo split knife paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBaking Traditional Steamed Sticky Rice in Bamboo Tubes (Com Lam) represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in highland campfire. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines fresh sweet mountain bamboo stalks with fragrant sticky rice and coconut. Travelers and researchers who practice roasting tubes on glowing embers gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight bamboo split knife as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
