      "audioUrl": "",
      "audioScript": "What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nI am presenting about Adventure Tourism: Caving Expeditions in Tu Lan Cave System at Tu Lan river valley.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nAudiences and experts are intrigued by underground river swimming sections and eager to practice swimming through dark cave rivers.\nHow does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nIt showcases towering limestone dry caverns and highlights the significance of waterproof headlamp helmet.\nBrilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In Tu Lan river valley, culinary masters and linguists emphasize underground river swimming sections as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace swimming through dark cave rivers, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding towering limestone dry caverns helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting waterproof headlamp helmet paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Adventure Tourism: Caving Expeditions in Tu Lan Cave System represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in Tu Lan river valley. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines underground river swimming sections with towering limestone dry caverns. Travelers and researchers who practice swimming through dark cave rivers gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight waterproof headlamp helmet as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In Tu Lan river valley, culinary masters and linguists emphasize underground river swimming sections as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace swimming through dark cave rivers, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding towering limestone dry caverns helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting waterproof headlamp helmet paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAdventure Tourism: Caving Expeditions in Tu Lan Cave System represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in Tu Lan river valley. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines underground river swimming sections with towering limestone dry caverns. Travelers and researchers who practice swimming through dark cave rivers gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight waterproof headlamp helmet as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Adventure Tourism: Caving Expeditions in Tu Lan Cave System represents a wonderful opportunity for cultural appreciation. Located in Tu Lan river valley, it celebrates underground river swimming sections and demonstrates how local heritage thrives. Taking part in swimming through dark cave rivers enriches our understanding of community values and promotes towering limestone dry caverns. Furthermore, respecting waterproof headlamp helmet reinforces ethical tourism and international understanding. I look forward to exploring more of these rich cultural traditions.",
