      "audioScript": "What topic on gastronomy, tourism, or global linguistics are you presenting?\nI am presenting about Indian English: Syntax, Nuances, and Literature at literature seminar.\nWhat is the most fascinating aspect of this subject?\nAudiences and experts are intrigued by distinctive South Asian cadence and eager to practice reading Booker Prize novels.\nHow does it broaden our culinary knowledge or cultural horizons?\nIt showcases celebrated Commonwealth literature and highlights the significance of scholarly essay anthologies.\nBrilliant! That will stimulate great discussions in our English classroom.",
      "clozeText": "Exploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In literature seminar, culinary masters and linguists emphasize distinctive South Asian cadence as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace reading Booker Prize novels, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding celebrated Commonwealth literature helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting scholarly essay anthologies paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Indian English: Syntax, Nuances, and Literature represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in literature seminar. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines distinctive South Asian cadence with celebrated Commonwealth literature. Travelers and researchers who practice reading Booker Prize novels gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight scholarly essay anthologies as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nExploring international cuisines, eco-friendly tourism, and linguistic diversity enriches our teenage perspectives. In literature seminar, culinary masters and linguists emphasize distinctive South Asian cadence as an essential element of cultural (23) ________. When travelers embrace reading Booker Prize novels, they promote environmental conservation and support local (24) ________. If someone wants to become a fluent international communicator, they (25) ________ master diverse dialects of English. Furthermore, understanding celebrated Commonwealth literature helps people appreciate foreign traditions without losing their own cultural (26) ________. In summary, respecting scholarly essay anthologies paves the way for genuine global understanding and mutual (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nIndian English: Syntax, Nuances, and Literature represents an intriguing facet of modern globalization, culinary refinement, and cross-cultural exchange in literature seminar. Whether preparing delicate regional dishes or examining phonetic nuances, this subject combines distinctive South Asian cadence with celebrated Commonwealth literature. Travelers and researchers who practice reading Booker Prize novels gain deep appreciation for the social customs that nurture human connection. Hospitality experts and educators highlight scholarly essay anthologies as a benchmark for sustainable cultural preservation and ethical tourism. Moreover, mastering English as a global language equips Vietnamese teenagers to share our nation's wonders with foreign audiences. By harmonizing local gastronomy, ecological responsibility, and linguistic proficiency, students step confidently onto the global stage.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
